  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Kart\u0131n t\xFCr\xFC ve nadirli\u011Fi dolap tabelas\u0131yla e\u015Fle\u015Fmeli.
    Kartlar\u0131 numara s\u0131ras\u0131na g\xF6re yerle\u015Ftir.\n\n\u0130lk do\u011Fru
    yerle\u015Ftirilen kart, raf\u0131n serisini belirler. T\xFCr\xFC, nadirli\u011Fi
    ve numaras\u0131 uysa bile ba\u015Fka seriden kartlar do\u011Fru say\u0131lmaz.\n\nBu
    kart\u0131 kald\u0131rarak rafta ba\u015Fka bir uygun seriye ba\u015Flayabilirsin."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19133410948514086983d0026b2d8795, type: 2}
